    },
    {
      "en": "Hello, everyone.",
      "asr_range": [
        1525,
        1527
      ],
      "start": 1047.5,
      "end": 1048.94
    },
    {
      "en": "Today I'll talk about how to improve your pronunciation.",
      "asr_range": [
        1527,
        1536
      ],
      "start": 1049.37,
      "end": 1054.41
    },
    {
      "en": "Language researchers say pronunciation and fluency are the biggest barriers, followed by grammar, in effective spoken English.",
      "asr_range": [
        1536,
        1553
      ],
      "start": 1054.65,
      "end": 1065.93
    },
    {
      "en": "However, most people don't regard pronunciation as a very important part of communication skills.",
      "asr_range": [
        1553,
        1567
      ],
      "start": 1066.17,
      "end": 1074.33
    },
    {
      "en": "They're more focused on vocabulary.",
      "asr_range": [
        1567,
        1572
      ],
      "start": 1075.08,
      "end": 1078.2
    },
    {
      "en": "One reason is that most people are not even aware of their mispronunciations.",
      "asr_range": [
        1572,
        1585
      ],
      "start": 1078.44,
      "end": 1086.2
    },
    {
      "en": "So it's important to first find out the words you mispronounce.",
      "asr_range": [
        1585,
        1596
      ],
      "start": 1086.44,
      "end": 1091.24
    },
    {
      "en": "You should listen to experts.",
      "asr_range": [
        1596,
        1601
      ],
      "start": 1092.05,
      "end": 1094.29
    },
    {
      "en": "By experts I mean those who are less likely to make pronunciation mistakes.",
      "asr_range": [
        1601,
        1614
      ],
      "start": 1094.53,
      "end": 1102.69
    },
    {
      "en": "When listening to them, pay attention to words that sound strange—strange because you pronounce the same words differently.",
      "asr_range": [
        1614,
        1633
      ],
      "start": 1102.93,
      "end": 1113.77
    },
    {
      "en": "When you come across such words, check a dictionary to confirm their exact pronunciations.",
      "asr_range": [
        1633,
        1647
      ],
      "start": 1114.01,
      "end": 1121.93
    },
    {
      "en": "You can also search for difficult-to-pronounce words and names, and make a list of them.",
      "asr_range": [
        1647,
        1664
      ],
      "start": 1122.56,
      "end": 1130.32
    },
    {
      "en": "The last suggestion is to read aloud.",
      "asr_range": [
        1664,
        1671
      ],
      "start": 1130.56,
      "end": 1134.4
    },
    {
      "en": "Now you've got the correct pronunciations of the words.",
